==Irish==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Ulster}} {{IPA|/fˠæː/|lang=ga}}

===Preposition===
{{ga-prep|d|l}}

# {{alternative form of|faoi||about, concerning|from=Ulster|lang=ga}}

====Usage notes====
The standard Irish and Connacht form {{m|ga|faoi}} (Munster {{m|ga|fé}}) means both ‘under’ and ‘about, concerning’. In Ulster, these two meanings are split: {{m|ga|faoi}} means ‘under’, while {{m|ga||fá}} means ‘about, concerning’.

